  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of the clergy",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the central figure of the clergy (specifically, the priest in the red chasuble) as 'my face' when waiting for cookies. This projection is established by the text overlay 'my face when im wating', which explicitly maps the viewer's self-perception onto the solemn expression of the clergy member. The humor arises from the user identifying with the visual material's expression in a mundane context.",
